{'symbol': 'SBAC', 'date': '2023-05-08 09:53:00', 'title': 'SBA COMMUNICATIONS CORPORATION TO SPEAK AT THE JP MORGAN 51ST ANNUAL GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'BOCA RATON, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SBA COMMUNICATIONS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: SBAC) (“SBA”) ANNOUNCES THAT JEFFREY A. STOOPS, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER IS SCHEDULED TO SPEAK AT THE JP MORGAN 51ST ANNUAL GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE, MONDAY, MAY 22, 2023 AT 8:40AM ET. THE CONFERENCE WILL BE AT THE WESTIN COPLEY PLACE IN BOSTON, MASSACHUSETTS. THE AUDIO PRESENTATION FOR SBA CAN BE ACCESSED BY VISITING WWW.SBASITE.COM. ABOUT SBA COMMUNICATIONS CORPORATION SBA COM.'}